@startuml
title Settlement-Decoupled Nanopayment Ledger: Core Flow
left to right direction
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam nodesep 16
skinparam ranksep 20
skinparam defaultFontName SansSerif
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam ArrowColor #536A7B
skinparam rectangle {
  BackgroundColor #F1F6FB
  BorderColor #536A7B
  FontColor #1D354A
  RoundCorner 12
}
rectangle "1. **User initiates payment**\n\nThe user requests payment\nthrough a participating institution" as step1
rectangle "2. **Parties verify and sign**\n\nThe payer institution,\npayee institution, and Payment Network\nverify the transaction and sign" as step2
rectangle "3. **Submit on-chain**\n\nThe submitter sends requests\nindividually or in a batch" as step3
rectangle "4. **Post to the ledger**\n\nThe ledger validates requests,\nposts entries, and emits events" as step4
rectangle "5. **Close statements**\n\nInstitutions call flush periodically\nas agreed to close on-chain statements" as step5
rectangle "6. **Settle fiat off-chain**\n\nOff-chain fiat systems settle\non the basis of the statements" as step6
step1 --> step2
step2 --> step3
step3 --> step4
step4 --> step5
step5 --> step6
@enduml
